<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18259] Shapshot creation fails from non-baseline node.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18259</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Snapshot is not created from non-baseline server node. The error is:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
